<title>USA: Morgan's board oks 1-for-6 reverse split.</title>
<headline>Morgan's board oks 1-for-6 reverse split.</headline>
<dateline>BEACHWOOD, Ohio 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan's Foods Inc said Tuesday that its board had approved a one-for-six reverse split of its common shares.</p>
<p>The company said the split must be approved by holders of two-thirds of the company's outstanding shares at its annual meeting June 30. Shareholders of record May 14 will be entitled to vote.</p>
<p>The company, which operates 39 Kentucky Fried Chicken restaurants and six East Side Mario's, said fractional shares will be settled in cash.</p>
</text>
